i e so u na ki ga shi ta</span></p><p begin="00:48.929" end="00:52.609" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="00:48.929" end="00:49.631">僕の</span><span begin="00:49.631" end="00:50.529">心の</span><span begin="00:50.529" end="00:51.412">全てを</span><span begin="00:51.412" end="00:52.609">奪った</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki ga su ru</span></p><p begin="00:52.619" end="00:56.974" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="00:52.619" end="00:53.352">どこか</span><span begin="00:53.352" end="00:54.016">儚</span><span begin="00:54.016" end="00:54.229">い</span><span begin="00:54.229" end="00:55.030">空気</span><span begin="00:55.030" end="00:55.355">を</span><span begin="00:55.442" end="00:55.909">纏</span><span begin="00:55.909" end="00:56.063">う</span><span begin="00:56.063" end="00:56.608">君</span><span begin="00:56.608" end="00:56.974">は</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">言语之风 轻然飘舞 掠过双颊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko to ba ka ze fu wa ri ho ho wo ka su me</span></p><p begin="00:56.982" end="00:59.901" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="00:56.982" end="00:57.483">寂</span><span begin="00:57.483" end="00:57.770">し</span><span begin="00:57.770" end="00:57.932">い</span><span begin="00:57.932" end="00:58.281">目</span><span begin="00:58.281" end="00:58.535">を</span><span begin="00:58.644" end="00:59.138">して</span><span begin="00:59.138" end="00:59.499">たん</span><span begin="00:59.499" end="00:59.901">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">爱恋就此开始</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko i ha ko n na fu u ni ha ji ma ru</span></p><p begin="01:00.391" end="01:04.074" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10"><span begin="01:00.391" end="01:01.152">いつだって</span><span begin="01:01.152" end="01:01.476">チック</span><span begin="01:01.476" end="01:01.824">タック</span><span begin="01:01.824" end="01:02.097">と</span> <span begin="01:02.233" end="01:02.561">鳴る</span><span begin="01:02.561" end="01:02.86