15.210" end="01:15.732">騒</span><span begin="01:15.732" end="01:15.923">が</span><span begin="01:15.923" end="01:16.240">しい</span><span begin="01:16.250" end="01:16.909">日々</span><span begin="01:16.909" end="01:17.156">に</span><span begin="01:17.156" end="01:17.828">笑え</span><span begin="01:17.828" end="01:18.242">ない</span><span begin="01:18.242" end="01:18.749">君</span><span begin="01:18.749" end="01:19.102">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想知道你心底的秘密</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a na ta no hi mi tsu mo shi ri ta i</span></p><p begin="01:19.115" end="01:22.823" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14"><span begin="01:19.115" end="01:19.618">思</span><span begin="01:19.618" end="01:19.887">い</span><span begin="01:19.887" end="01:20.362">付く</span><span begin="01:20.362" end="01:21.032">限り</span><span begin="01:21.032" end="01:21.460">眩</span><span begin="01:21.460" end="01:21.878">しい</span><span begin="01:21.878" end="01:22.451">明日</span><span begin="01:22.451" end="01:22.823">を</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da re yo ri so ba de wa ra u yo fu wa ri</span></p><p begin="01:22.833" end="01:26.529" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15"><span begin="01:22.833" end="01:23.421">明け</span><span begin="01:23.421" end="01:23.714">ない</span><span begin="01:23.714" end="01:24.253">夜</span><span begin="01:24.253" end="01:24.506">に</span><span begin="01:24.506" end="01:24.919">落ち</span><span begin="01:24.919" end="01:25.170">て</span><span begin="01:25.170" end="01:25.607">ゆく</span><span begin="01:25.607" end="01:26.182">前</span><span begin="01:26.182" end="01:26.529">に</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko to ba ka ze fu wa ri ah ah</span></p><p begin="01:26.539" end="01:29.574" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16"><span begin="01:26.539" end="01:27.220">僕の</span><span begin="01:27.263" end="01:27.667">手を</span><span begin="01:27.667" end="01:28.391">掴ん</span><span begin="01:28.391" end="01:28.634">で</span><span begin="01:28